Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前，在一个非常遥远的星系里…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:49.39,Title,0,0,0,0,,《星球大战：绝地归来》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.39,0:00:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者卢克回到了他的母星塔图因
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.52,0:01:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,试图从大恶棍赫特族的贾巴手中救出他的朋友，汉·索罗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.95,0:01:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是卢克并不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.08,0:01:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国正秘密开始建设一个新的武装空间站
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.30,0:01:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,其威力比第一颗死星还要强大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.51,0:01:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦它建成，这个终极武器就将决定反抗者的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.72,0:01:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,而此时，反抗者们还在为重建星际间的自由而奋斗…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.86,0:02:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥站，这里是ST-321号，通行密码为蓝色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command station, this is ST-321. Code clearance blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.49,0:02:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们即将着陆，请解除护盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're starting our approach. Deactivate the security shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.20,0:02:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们能确认你们的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}The security deflector shield will be deactivated…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.37,0:02:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就会解除护盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we have confirmation of your code transmission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.79,0:02:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以着陆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are clear to proceed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.46,0:02:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备着陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're starting our approach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.70,0:03:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉指挥官维德勋爵的飞船已经抵达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inform the commander that Lord Vader's shuttle has arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.95,0:03:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,维德勋爵，见到您真是意外之喜，我们深感荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Vader, this is an unexpected pleasure. We're honoured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.08,0:04:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以省掉这种客套了，指挥官阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may dispense with the pleasantries, Commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.50,0:04:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来此是监督你们按期办事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to put you back on schedule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.12,0:04:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向您保证，维德勋爵，我的人正全力工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assure you, Lord Vader, my men are working as fast as they can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.29,0:04:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也许我能找到个新方法让他们更努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I can find new ways to motivate them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.05,0:04:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如我所说，整个空间站将如期投入使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you this station will be operational as planned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.80,0:04:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇帝陛下对局势的评估可没有你这么乐观\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor does not share your optimistic appraisal of the situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.23,0:04:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他所要求的是不可能的，我需要更多的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he asks the impossible. I need more men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.56,0:04:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那等他驾临的时候，也许你也能向他这么回奏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then perhaps you can tell him when he arrives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.94,0:04:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 皇帝陛下会驾临此地？ - 完全正确，指挥官阁下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The emperor's coming here? - That is correct, Commander…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.57,0:04:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他肯定会对你工作缺乏进展深感不满\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he is most displeased with your apparent lack of progress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.12,0:04:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将加倍努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall double our efforts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.04,0:04:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望如此，指挥官阁下，这也是为了你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so, Commander, for your sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.46,0:04:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇帝陛下可不会像我一样宽容大度\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor is not as forgiving as I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.27,0:05:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然担心，你也该担心啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I'm worried. And you should be too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.86,0:05:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰多·卡尔瑞辛和可怜的楚巴卡不会从这个差劲的地方回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lando Calrissian and poor Chewbacca never returned from this awful place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.07,0:05:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.20,0:05:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是把赫特族的贾巴的事情告诉你一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I told you half the things I've heard about this Jabba the Hutt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.62,0:05:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就得短路\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd probably short-circuit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.01,0:05:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，你肯定他们就在这吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, are you sure this is the right place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.18,0:05:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我还是敲门比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd better knock, I suppose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.15,0:05:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像这里没什么人，我们回去告诉卢克主人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There doesn't seem to be anyone here. Let's go back and tell Master Luke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.65,0:05:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodness gracious me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.89,0:06:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们是不会让我们进去的，R2\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think they're going to let us in, R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.06,0:06:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd better go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.03,0:06:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.57,0:06:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天啊，R2\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear. R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.66,0:06:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，我坚信我们不该这么冒然闯入的\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, I really don't think we should rush into all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.00,0:06:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，R2！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, R2!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，等等我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, wait for me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.93,0:06:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就把卢克主人的口信告诉他们然后我们就走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just you deliver Master Luke's message and get us out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.60,0:06:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.73,0:07:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.20,0:07:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给你的主人，赫特族的贾巴带来个口信\N{\fnArial\fs30}We bring a message to your master, Jabba the Hutt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.75,0:07:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么礼物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What gift?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.94,0:07:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我们只能告诉贾巴本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says that our instructions are to give it only to Jabba himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.03,0:08:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉，不过我想他对这种事情从来就是这么固执的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm terribly sorry. I'm afraid he's ever so stubborn about these sort of things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.17,0:08:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，我对此有个不好的预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, I have a bad feeling about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.41,0:08:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.55,0:08:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,口信，R2，口信呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The message, R2. The message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊贵的阁下，谨致以崇高的敬意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greetings, Exalted One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许我介绍自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to introduce myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是天行者卢克，绝地武士，索罗船长的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Luke Skywalker, Jedi knight and friend to Captain Solo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.69,0:09:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是伟大强悍的贾巴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that you are powerful, mighty Jabba…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.49,0:09:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也理解你对索罗也一定怒气冲天\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that your anger with Solo must be equally powerful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.28,0:09:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我期望阁下可以听听我的建议，看什么可以用来交换索罗的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seek an audience with Your Greatness to bargain for Solo's life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.88,0:09:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,以您的智慧，我相信我们一定可以找到一个方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your wisdom, I'm sure we can work out an arrangement…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.63,0:09:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们都有利\N{\fnArial\fs30}which will be mutually beneficial…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.46,0:09:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且可以避免我们之间发生不愉快的冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}and enable us to avoid any unpleasant confrontation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.18,0:09:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了表示我的善意，我有一份礼物送给您\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a token of my goodwill, I present to you a gift-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.55,0:09:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这两个机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}these two droids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.43,0:09:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.43,0:09:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都很勤劳，会好好替你服务的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both are hard-working and will serve you well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能，R2，你肯定放错消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be. R2, you're playing the wrong message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.45,0:09:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's no Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.87,0:10:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么交易好谈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be no bargain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.83,0:10:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doomed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.17,0:10:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会放弃我最喜欢的装饰品的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not give up my favourite decoration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.64,0:10:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢索罗船长待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like Captain Solo where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.77,0:10:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，看，索罗船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, look. Captain Solo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.98,0:10:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在被碳化冷冻着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's still frozen in carbonite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克主人到底是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could possibly have come over Master Luke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.16,0:10:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我做错什么事了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it something I did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.62,0:10:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从来没有对我的工作表示什么不满啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never expressed any unhappiness with my work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.17,0:10:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How horrid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.49,0:11:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错啊，新货色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. New acquisitions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.16,0:11:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个礼仪机器人，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a protocol droid, are you not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.91,0:11:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是C-3PO…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am C-3PO-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答是或不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes or no will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.83,0:11:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那，是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.46,0:11:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会说多少种语言？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many languages do you speak?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.09,0:11:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以流利使用超过六百万种交流方式，而且可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am fluent in over six million forms of communication and can readily…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.84,0:11:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了，我们已经好久没有翻译了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splendid. We have been without an interpreter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.60,0:11:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,上个礼仪机器人得罪了我们的主人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}since our master got angry with our last protocol droid…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.06,0:11:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后被分解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and disintegrated him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.98,0:11:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,分解？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disintegrated?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.52,0:11:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,警卫，这个礼仪机器人可能有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guard, this protocol droid might be useful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.40,0:11:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他装上防逃螺栓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fit him with a restraining bolt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.70,0:11:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后带他去大人的剧场去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take him back up to His Excellency's main audience chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:12:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，别离开我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, don't leave me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.83,0:12:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个坏脾气的小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a feisty little one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.05,0:12:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你马上就会懂得什么叫尊重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you'll soon learn some respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.63,0:12:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你去主人的游船那里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have need for you on the master's sail barge…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你在那里会很合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think you'll fill in nicely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！再表演一次！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Do that again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.12,0:14:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来领这个伍基族人的赏金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have come for the bounty on this Wookiee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.38,0:14:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不，楚巴卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Chewbacca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.38,0:14:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我们抓住了强大的楚巴卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last we have the mighty Chewbacca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.81,0:15:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里，尊敬的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am here, Your Worshipfulness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.77,0:15:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何吩咐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.33,0:15:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,光荣的贾巴对你表示欢迎…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The illustrious Jabba bids you welcome…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.41,0:15:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,并很高兴付你二万五千元酬劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}and will gladly pay you the reward of 25, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.04,0:15:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要五万，一分不能少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want 50, 000. No less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,“五万，一分不能少”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"50, 000. No less."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.93,0:15:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的贾巴问为什么他要付五万\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mighty Jabba asks why he must pay 50, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.57,0:15:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他带了一个热核引爆器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he's holding a thermal detonator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.17,0:16:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个赏金猎人和我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This bounty hunter is my kind of scum…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.64,0:16:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所畏惧而又富有创新精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}fearless and inventive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.86,0:16:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾巴愿意付三万五\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jabba offers the sum of 35…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I do suggest you take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.53,0:16:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他同意了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He agrees!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.34,0:19:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,先休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax for a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.88,0:19:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从碳化冷冻中被解救出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're free of the carbonite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.60,0:19:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你还有休眠反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have hibernation sickness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.18,0:19:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看不见 - 你的视力会恢复的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't see. - Your eyesight will return in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.77,0:19:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在哪里？ - 贾巴的宫殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where am I? - Jabba's palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.36,0:19:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.99,0:20:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个爱你的人 - 莉娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Someone who loves you. - Leia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.04,0:20:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得救你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.67,0:20:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么声音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.18,0:20:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听过这个笑声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that laugh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.02,0:20:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，贾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jabba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.44,0:20:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说，贾巴，我正要付给你钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Jabba, I was just on my way to pay you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.40,0:20:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是有事耽搁了我一下，这不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a little sidetracked. It's not my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.40,0:20:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了，索罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late for that, Solo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.24,0:20:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来可以是一个很好的走私客的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may have been a good smuggler…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.08,0:20:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你现在只能做本莎兽的饲料\N{\fnArial\fs30}but now you're Bantha fodder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.21,0:20:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.46,0:20:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.63,0:20:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾巴，我会给你三倍的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jabba, I'll pay you triple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.51,0:20:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛要凭白放弃一大笔钱呢，别犯傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're throwing away a fortune here. Don't be a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.93,0:20:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她带上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring her to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.14,0:21:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有强大的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have powerful friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.31,0:21:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会后悔这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna regret this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.44,0:21:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.37,0:21:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't bear to watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊？（楚巴卡的昵称）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.05,0:21:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊？是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.97,0:21:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，我看不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. I can't see, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.64,0:21:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.11,0:21:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克？卢克疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke? Luke's crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.82,0:21:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他连自己都照顾不好，还想救别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't even take care of himself, much less rescue anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.24,0:21:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他成了绝地武士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Jedi knight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.99,0:21:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一阵子和外界没什么联系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out of it for a little while, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.88,0:22:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么每个人都幻想自己变成伟大人物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}everybody gets delusions of grandeur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.25,0:22:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还好，朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.92,0:22:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.44,0:23:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要和贾巴谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must speak with Jabba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.78,0:23:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么交易好谈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No bargain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.82,0:23:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在带我去见贾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will take me to Jabba now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.74,0:23:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好替你的主人服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}You serve your master well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.50,0:23:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会得到丰厚奖赏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will be rewarded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.30,0:23:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于来了，卢克主人终于来救我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last! Master Luke's come to rescue me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.68,0:23:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.18,0:23:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者卢克，绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke Skywalker, Jedi knight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.40,0:23:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你不要让他进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you not to admit him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.77,0:23:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须要和你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must be allowed to speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.69,0:23:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须要和你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must be allowed to speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.28,0:23:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个精神脆弱的笨蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weak-minded fool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.29,0:24:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只不过用绝地武士那套精神控制的老把戏而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's using an old Jedi mind trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.75,0:24:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会把索罗船长和伍基族的人交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will bring Captain Solo and the Wookiee to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.18,0:24:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的精神力量对我无效，小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mind powers will not work on me, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.47,0:24:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nevertheless…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.77,0:24:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带走索罗船长和他的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking Captain Solo and his friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.85,0:24:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或者把他们卖给我赚钱，或者我把你干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can either profit by this or be destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.82,0:24:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己掂量着办，不过我要警告你别低估我的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your choice, but I warn you not to underestimate my powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.03,0:24:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克主人，你正站在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Luke, you're standing on-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.24,0:24:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么交易好谈的，小绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be no bargain, young Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.04,0:24:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会很高兴看到你怎么死掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall enjoy watching you die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.66,0:25:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不！仇恨兽！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! The rancor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.58,0:28:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,把索罗和伍基族的那家伙给我带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me Solo and the Wookiee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.38,0:28:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会为这暴行付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will all suffer for this outrage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.48,0:28:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.03,0:28:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？ - 很好，我们又在一起了，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you all right? - Fine. Together again, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.37,0:28:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可不想 - 我们现在情况如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wouldn't miss it. - How are we doin'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.91,0:28:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还是老样子 - 有那么差吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Same as always. - That bad, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.71,0:28:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莉娅在哪里？ - 我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Leia? - I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.84,0:28:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.17,0:28:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊贵的主人，伟大的赫特族的贾巴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}His High Exaltedness, the great Jabba the Hutt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.38,0:28:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经饬令对你们立即处以死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}has decreed that you are to be terminated immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.55,0:28:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，我不喜欢长时间的等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. I hate long waits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.60,0:29:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此你们将被带到沙丘海…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will therefore be taken to the Dune Sea…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.31,0:29:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,投入卡库恩洞穴之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}and cast into the Pit of Carkoon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.77,0:29:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里居住着强大的沙列克\N{\fnArial\fs30}nesting place of the all-powerful Sarlacc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.19,0:29:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不算太差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't sound so bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.53,0:29:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他肚子里面你们会更明白什么叫做受难和痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}In his belly, you will find a new definition of pain and suffering…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.53,0:29:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们将会在超过1000年中被缓慢消化\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you are slowly digested over 1, 000 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.12,0:29:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又想了一下，让我们这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}On second thought, let's pass on that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.37,0:29:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是该接受我们的交易，贾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have bargained, Jabba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.83,0:29:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会是你犯的最后一个错误了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the last mistake you'll ever make.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.85,0:30:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我的眼睛好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think my eyes are getting better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.68,0:30:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前是一大片黑暗，现在是一大片光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of a big dark blur, I see a big light blur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.69,0:30:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好看的，我曾经住在这里，你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to see. I used to live here, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.98,0:30:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也要死在这里了，倒是挺合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna die here, you know. Convenient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.94,0:30:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠楚伊和兰多近点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stick close to Chewie and Lando.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.36,0:30:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经把一切都处理好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've taken care of everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.58,0:30:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的很\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.00,0:30:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快你就学着感激我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon you will learn to appreciate me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.26,0:30:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm terribly sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.67,0:30:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，你在这里干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, what are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.72,0:30:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在这里送饮料，但是这里可危险的很\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see you're serving drinks, but this place is dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.89,0:31:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要处决卢克主人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to execute Master Luke, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.37,0:31:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不当心点，我们也得完蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if we're not careful, us too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.73,0:31:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望我也能像你那么自信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I had your confidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.96,0:31:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙列克的祭品们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victims of the almighty Sarlacc…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.30,0:31:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊贵的主人希望你们能死的有尊严\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Excellency hopes that you will die honourably.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.30,0:31:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过如果你们之中谁要请求他的宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}But should any of you wish to beg for mercy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.02,0:31:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的赫特族的贾巴现在将聆听你们的恳求\N{\fnArial\fs30}the great Jabba the Hutt will now listen to your pleas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.23,0:31:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO，你告诉他那个大混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}3PO, you tell that slimy piece of worm-ridden filth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.70,0:31:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会从我们这里得到这种满足的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll get no such pleasure from us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.45,0:31:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.54,0:32:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾巴，这是你最后的机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your last chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.75,0:32:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我们走，不然就去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free us or die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.30,0:32:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带到那里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move him into position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.28,0:32:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,推他进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.98,0:33:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点，楚伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, Chewie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.41,0:33:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.62,0:33:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊，你被击中了？伤在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, you're hit? Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.92,0:33:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉，楚伊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han, Chewie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.51,0:33:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lando.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.73,0:33:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,博巴·费特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boba Fett?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.02,0:33:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,博巴·费特？在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boba Fett? Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.64,0:34:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 兰多，抓住它！ - 再低点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lando, grab it! - Lower it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.77,0:34:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在努力呢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.29,0:34:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住我，楚伊，抓住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab me, Chewie. Grab it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.43,0:35:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他，就差一点了，你马上就碰到它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab it. Almost. You almost got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.07,0:35:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gently, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.53,0:35:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻点，抓住我，楚伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy. Hold me, Chewie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.34,0:35:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊，给我枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, give me the gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.01,0:35:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 兰多，别动 - 等等！你不是看不见吗！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't move, Lando. - Wait! I thought you were blind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.13,0:35:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在视力好多了，别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see a lot better. Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.26,0:35:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再瞄高点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little higher!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.97,0:35:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊，拉我们上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, pull us up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.10,0:35:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉啊，楚伊，拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up, Chewie. Up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.48,0:35:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.77,0:35:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我的眼睛！R2，救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my eyes! R2, help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.69,0:35:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，R2！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly, R2!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.16,0:35:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,野兽！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.58,0:36:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,去炮那里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.54,0:36:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄向甲板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point it at the deck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.34,0:36:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄向甲板！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point it at the deck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.68,0:36:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，我们去哪里？我可能不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, where are we going? I couldn't possibly-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.44,0:36:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.94,0:36:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们离开这里吧，别忘了机器人 - 我们上路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. Don't forget the droids. - We're on our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.95,0:37:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在舰队这里等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you back at the fleet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.82,0:37:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，联盟军现在应该已经集合了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry. The Alliance should be assembled by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.58,0:37:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会的 - 卢克，谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will. - Luke, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.37,0:37:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你来救我，我欠你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for coming after me. Now I owe you one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.34,0:37:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，R2，我们现在去达古巴星系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, R2. We're going to the Dagobah system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.18,0:37:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向一个老友保证要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a promise to keep…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.56,0:37:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我得去实践我的诺言\N{\fnArial\fs30}to an old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.70,0:38:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,平身，我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.87,0:38:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,死星将如期完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Death Star will be completed on schedule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.92,0:38:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干的不错，维德勋爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done well, Lord Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.55,0:38:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我感觉你想继续寻找年轻的天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I sense you wish to continue your search for young Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.85,0:38:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.06,0:39:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,耐心点，我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patience, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.81,0:39:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候，他会来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In time, he will seek you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.27,0:39:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他来的时候，你一定要把他带到我的面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he does, you must bring him before me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.82,0:39:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经变强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has grown strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.24,0:39:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我们一起才能把他拉到“原力”的黑暗面来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only together can we turn him to the dark side of the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.04,0:39:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如您所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.41,0:39:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有事情都如同我预见的一样进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is proceeding as I have foreseen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.86,0:39:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那是什么表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}That face you make-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.78,0:39:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得我太老了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look I so old to young eyes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.45,0:40:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.62,0:40:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.38,0:40:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.51,0:40:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,疾病缠身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sick have I become.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.13,0:40:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,又老又虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old and weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.77,0:40:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你九百岁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When 900 years old you reach…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.81,0:40:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也好不到哪里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}look as good you will not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.53,0:40:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快就会休息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon will I rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.78,0:40:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，彻底的安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Forever sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.53,0:40:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我应得的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earned it I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.29,0:40:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤达大师，你不能死啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Yoda, you can't die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.54,0:40:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管我的“原力”很强大…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong am I with the Force…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.33,0:40:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我身体已经不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not that strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.01,0:40:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,双星即将降临，很快夜晚就要来到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twilight is upon me, and soon night must fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.10,0:41:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是世界之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the way of things…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.94,0:41:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,“原力”之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}the way of the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.98,0:41:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.98,0:41:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来此是要完成我的训练的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come back to complete the training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.28,0:41:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要什么训练了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more training do you require.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.53,0:41:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要的你已经都知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already know you that which you need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.79,0:41:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我已经是绝地武士了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I am a Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.96,0:41:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.76,0:41:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还差一件事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing remains-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.80,0:41:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,维德，你必须对抗维德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vader. You must confront Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.02,0:41:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时，只有那时，你才成为一名绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then…only then… a Jedi will you be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.90,0:41:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你会对抗他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And confront him you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.70,0:41:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤达大师…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Yoda…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.91,0:42:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,达斯·维德是我父亲吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}is Darth Vader my father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.46,0:42:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest I need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.09,0:42:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.63,0:42:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.09,0:42:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤达，我必须知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yoda, I must know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.47,0:42:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.94,0:42:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉你了，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you, did he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.24,0:42:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.45,0:42:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unexpected this is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.74,0:42:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,太不幸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And unfortunate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.96,0:42:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸我知道了事实？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunate that I know the truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.12,0:42:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.63,0:42:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸你那么早面对他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunate that you rushed to face him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.67,0:42:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的训练还没有结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}that incomplete was your training…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.30,0:42:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你要承担的重任还没做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}that not ready for the burden were you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.81,0:43:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.65,0:43:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住，绝地武士的力量来自于“原力”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, a Jedi's strength flows from the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.20,0:43:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是要小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But beware.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.08,0:43:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,愤怒，恐惧，好战…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anger, fear, aggression…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.75,0:43:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是黑暗的一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dark side are they.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.12,0:43:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你踏上了黑暗之路…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you start down the dark path…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.96,0:43:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就永远无法回头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}forever will it dominate your destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.97,0:43:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.81,0:43:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万不要低估皇帝的力量…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not underestimate the powers of the emperor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.40,0:43:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你会落得和你父亲一样的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}or suffer your father's fate you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.33,0:43:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我死去了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When gone am I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.25,0:44:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将是最后一个绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}the last of the Jedi will you be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.84,0:44:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们家族的人对于原力都很有天份\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Force runs strong in your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.43,0:44:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你所学的传于后世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass on what you have learned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.86,0:44:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就将会有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.82,0:44:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}another…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.66,0:44:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.81,0:45:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法办到，R2\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do it, R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.57,0:45:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法独自前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go on alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.11,0:45:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤达永远与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yoda will always be with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.36,0:45:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比·旺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obi-Wan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.62,0:46:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不告诉我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.37,0:46:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我说维德背叛和谋杀了我的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me Vader betrayed and murdered my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.38,0:46:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父亲被“原力”的黑暗面所吸引\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father was seduced by the dark side of the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.01,0:46:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他就不再是天行者安纳金，而变成了达斯·维德\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ceased to be Anakin Skywalker and became Darth Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.06,0:46:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当此事发生之时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When that happened…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.68,0:46:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个曾经是好人的你的父亲就被毁灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the good man who was your father was destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.89,0:46:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以从某种角度来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what I told you was true…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.44,0:46:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你的是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a certain point of view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.40,0:46:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种角度？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A certain point of view?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.99,0:46:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，你将会发现，我们坚信的很多事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke, you're going to find that many of the truths we cling to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.99,0:46:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,极大程度上都源于我们自己看问题的角度\N{\fnArial\fs30}depend greatly on our own point of view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.70,0:46:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金是一个好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin was a good friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.37,0:46:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我第一次见到他时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I first knew him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.08,0:46:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲已经是一个伟大的飞行员…\N{\fnArial\fs30}your father was already a great pilot…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.38,0:46:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我对于他身上的“原力”那么强大无比惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was amazed how strongly the Force was with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.13,0:46:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我亲自把他训练成为一名绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took it upon myself to train him as a Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.22,0:46:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我可以把他教导的如同尤达一样好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that I could instruct him just as well as Yoda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.26,0:46:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.52,0:47:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他身上还有善良存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is still good in him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.52,0:47:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在更多的是一部机器，而不是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's more machine now than man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.40,0:47:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他扭曲而邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}twisted and evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.11,0:47:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我办不到，本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do it, Ben.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.44,0:47:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能逃避你自己的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot escape your destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.49,0:47:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要再次面对达斯·维德\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must face Darth Vader again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.87,0:47:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能杀掉自己的亲生父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't kill my own father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.91,0:47:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那皇帝已经赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the emperor has already won.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.04,0:47:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我们唯一的希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were our only hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.59,0:47:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤达提到了另外一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yoda spoke of another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.76,0:47:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他提到的另外一个是你的孪生姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other he spoke of is your twin sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.26,0:47:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我没有姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have no sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.35,0:47:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保护你们不受皇帝的迫害\N{\fnArial\fs30}To protect you both from the emperor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.39,0:47:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一出生，就瞒住了你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were hidden from your father when you were born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.11,0:47:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如同我一样，皇帝也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor knew, as I did…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.69,0:47:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果安纳金有任何后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}if Anakin were to have any offspring…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.53,0:47:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们将成为对他的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}they would be a threat to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.20,0:48:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么你的姐妹要安全的匿名生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the reason why your sister remains safely anonymous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.04,0:48:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莉娅是我的姐妹 - 你的直觉很准确\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leia is my sister. - Your insight serves you well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.30,0:48:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的感情埋在心底吧，卢克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bury your feelings deep down, Luke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.30,0:48:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会为你服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do you credit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.80,0:48:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是它们也会为帝国皇帝所利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they could be made to serve the emperor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.37,0:48:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你啊，成了将军了，啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you. A general, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.16,0:48:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有人告诉他们我在塔纳战役中的杰出表现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone must have told them about my manoeuvre at the Battle of Tanaab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.38,0:48:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看我啊，朋友，我只是和他们说你是个不错的飞行员而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look at me, pal. I just said you were a fair pilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.38,0:48:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他们是要找人来指挥这个疯狂攻击的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know they were looking for somebody to lead this crazy attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.47,0:48:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是很奇怪他们没有让你来做这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised they didn't ask you to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.47,0:48:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说他们没有，只是我没有那么疯狂而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says they didn't? But I ain't crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.55,0:48:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可是名人啊，记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the respectable one, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.69,0:49:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇帝犯了一个重大错误，现在轮到我们攻击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor's made a critical error and the time for our attack has come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.44,0:49:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯森间谍们给我提供的数据标明了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The data brought to us by the Bothan spies pinpoint the exact location…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.45,0:49:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国新战斗基地的准确位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the emperor's new battle station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.70,0:49:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们同时得知死星上的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We also know that the weapon systems…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.62,0:49:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器系统还不能正常工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}of this Death Star are not yet operational.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.00,0:49:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,而整个帝国舰队散布于银河之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the imperial fleet spread throughout the galaxy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.08,0:49:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,徒劳的寻找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a vain effort to engage us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.71,0:49:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此它现在基本上是不设防的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is relatively unprotected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.71,0:49:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而最关键的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But most important of all…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.67,0:49:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得知皇帝本人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've learned that the emperor himself…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.72,0:49:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在正在亲自视察…\N{\fnArial\fs30}is personally overseeing the final stages…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.97,0:49:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,死星建造的最后阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the construction of this Death Star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.31,0:49:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了给我们提供这个消息，很多伯森人牺牲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many Bothans died to bring us this information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.31,0:49:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿克巴司令，请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Ackbar, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.77,0:49:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这里看到的就是死星围绕恩多星的布满森林的卫星旋转\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see here the Death Star orbiting the forest moon of Endor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.03,0:49:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管死星上的武器系统还不能正常工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although the weapon systems on this Death Star are not yet operational…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.62,0:50:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,死星本身还是有很强的防御机制\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Death Star does have a strong defence mechanism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.42,0:50:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,它被一层能量盾保护着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is protected by an energy shield…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.83,0:50:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这个能量盾是在恩多的那颗卫星上产生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is generated from the nearby forest moon of Endor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.09,0:50:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们尝试任何攻击之前，护盾必须要被解除\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shield must be deactivated if any attack is to be attempted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.27,0:50:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦护盾被解除，我们的巡洋舰将建立一道环行防线…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the shield is down, our cruisers will create a perimeter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.31,0:50:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而战斗机将飞进这个超级建筑\N{\fnArial\fs30}while the fighters fly into the superstructure…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.36,0:50:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,试图摧毁主反应堆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and attempt to knock out the main reactor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.20,0:50:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔瑞辛将军自愿指挥战斗机的攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Calrissian has volunteered to lead the fighter attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.32,0:50:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.24,0:50:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会需要好运的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.33,0:50:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦迪恩将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Madine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.08,0:50:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们偷了一艘帝国的小型飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have stolen a small imperial shuttle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.13,0:50:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它假扮成一艘运输船，然后使用一个秘密的帝国密码…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disguised as a cargo ship and using a secret imperial code…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.47,0:50:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以把一队攻击部队运到卫星上去解除护盾的发生器\N{\fnArial\fs30}a strike team will land on the moon and deactivate the shield generator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.39,0:50:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.76,0:51:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在猜他们会找谁接这个苦活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonder who they found to pull that off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.18,0:51:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,索罗将军，你的攻击部队召集完毕了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Solo, is your strike team assembled?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.98,0:51:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的队伍做好准备了，但是我缺乏飞船的指挥人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}My team's ready. I don't have a command crew for the shuttle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.40,0:51:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会很难的，我不想提起你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be rough. I didn't wanna speak for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.95,0:51:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧，你算一个 - 将军，算我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's one. - General, count me in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.03,0:51:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.83,0:51:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 以后再问我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - Ask me again sometime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.63,0:51:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卢克 - 嗨，汉，楚伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Luke. - Hi, Han, Chewie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.47,0:51:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,“振奋人心”这样的词也无法表达此情此景\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Exciting" is hardly the word I would choose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.53,0:51:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，我希望你乘她去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I want you to take her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.70,0:51:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说真的，乘她去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it. Take her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.37,0:51:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会拥有的所需的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need all the help you can get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.07,0:51:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可是舰队里面最快的飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the fastest ship in the fleet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.91,0:52:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦，老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, old buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.37,0:52:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她对你意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what she means to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.50,0:52:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会好好照顾她的，她连个划痕都不会有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take good care of her. She won't get a scratch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.50,0:52:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.05,0:52:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.22,0:52:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可是向我保证了，一个划痕都不会有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got your promise. Not a scratch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.93,0:52:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以出发了吧，海盗先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you get going, you pirate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.85,0:52:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.15,0:52:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.78,0:52:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 预热了吗？ - 是的，她做好准备了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got her warmed? - Yeah, she's coming up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.41,0:52:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我估计帝国设计她的时候没考虑到会有伍基人会乘坐的，楚伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think the Empire had Wookiees in mind when they designed her, Chewie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.34,0:52:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，你清醒着吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you awake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.43,0:53:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我只是有种很奇怪的感觉，好像我再也见不到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I just got a funny feeling, like I'm not gonna see her again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.02,0:53:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，将军，我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, General. Let's move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.52,0:53:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，楚伊，让我们看看这堆垃圾能干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Chewie, let's see what this piece of junk can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.98,0:53:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家都准备好了吗？ - 都好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready, everybody? - All set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.74,0:53:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们又上路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.54,0:53:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.77,0:53:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问圣意如何？我的主人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is thy bidding, my master?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.32,0:53:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,派遣舰队去恩多星系的远端\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send the fleet to the far side of Endor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.70,0:53:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们在那里待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it will stay until called for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.66,0:54:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那对于反叛军在索拉斯特星系附近大规模活动的报告怎么处理？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of the reports of the rebel fleet massing near Sullust?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.83,0:54:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这无关紧要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is of no concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.63,0:54:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快反叛军就会被扑灭，而年轻的天行者会成为我们之中的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon the rebellion will be crushed and young Skywalker will be one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.01,0:54:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里的任务已经完成了，我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your work here is finished, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.93,0:54:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,去指挥舰上等待我的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go out to the command ship and await my orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.72,0:54:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命，我的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.36,0:54:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是这招不灵，我们得赶快跑路\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they don't go for this, we're gonna have to get out pretty quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.66,0:54:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,贵机已经出现在我们的屏幕上了，请证实你们的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have you on our screen now. Please identify.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.92,0:54:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰德瑞姆号小型飞船请求解除偏导护盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuttle Tydirium requesting deactivation of the deflector shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.38,0:54:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰德瑞姆号，请发送解除护盾的通行密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuttle Tydirium, transmit the clearance code for shield passage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.85,0:55:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在发送中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transmission commencing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.39,0:55:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们就会知道这密码值不值得我们付出那么大代价了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we find out if that code is worth the price we paid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.52,0:55:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有效的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll work. It'll work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.07,0:55:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,维德在那艘船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vader's on that ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.36,0:55:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，别那么神经过敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get jittery, Luke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.32,0:55:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有好多指挥船呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are a lot of command ships.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.62,0:55:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持距离，楚伊，但是别让他们发现你在保持距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your distance, Chewie, but don't look like you're keeping your distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.45,0:55:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道怎么办，就正常飞好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Fly casual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.17,0:55:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘飞船要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is that shuttle going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.92,0:55:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰德瑞姆号，你上面装了什么，你的目的地是哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuttle Tydirium, what is your cargo and destination?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.22,0:55:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,森林卫星需要的零件和技术人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parts and technical crew for the forest moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.47,0:55:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有通行密码吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they have a code clearance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.89,0:55:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个老密码了，长官，不过是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an older code, sir, but it checks out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.27,0:55:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备让他们通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was about to clear them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.07,0:55:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该来的，我来了会让这个任务更难完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm endangering the mission. I shouldn't have come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.45,0:55:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是你的想像而已，孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your imagination, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.87,0:55:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊，让我们乐观点不好吗！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's keep a little optimism here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.75,0:56:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我抓住他们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I hold them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.30,0:56:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，让他们来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Leave them to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.30,0:56:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会亲自处理他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will deal with them myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.47,0:56:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如您所愿，大人，继续吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish, my lord. Carry on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.56,0:56:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们放我们过去了，楚伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not going for it, Chewie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.65,0:56:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰德瑞姆号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuttle Tydirium…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.48,0:56:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,护盾马上就会解除\N{\fnArial\fs30}deactivation of the shield will commence immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.99,0:56:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持你们的航线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow your present course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.40,0:56:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看，我告诉你们会成功的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I told you it was gonna work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.03,0:56:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么问题都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.61,0:57:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你们这里很危险吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you it was dangerous here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.09,0:57:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要不我们绕一下路怎么样？ - 太花时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Should we try and go around? - It'll take time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.67,0:57:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是让他们看到我们，我们整队人就白来一趟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole party will be for nothing if they see us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.51,0:57:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊和我会处理这问题的，你待这里别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie and I will take care of this. You stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.93,0:57:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要安静点，那边可能有更多敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quietly. There might be more of them out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.73,0:57:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.23,0:57:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,连我都不相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.13,0:58:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,去叫支援！快去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go for help! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.26,0:58:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了，上啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.32,0:58:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边！还有两个敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there! Two more of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.32,0:58:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他们了，等着，莉娅！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see them. Wait. Leia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.49,0:58:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.25,0:58:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，阻塞他们的通讯频道，用中间那个开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick, jam their comlink. Centre switch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.35,0:59:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠近点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.40,0:59:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,到他侧面去贴住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get alongside that one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.27,0:59:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你继续追这个家伙，我去对付那两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep on that one. I'll take these two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.33,1:02:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,索罗将军，有人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Solo, somebody's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.43,1:02:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉娅在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Leia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.43,1:02:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她还没回来？ - 我还以为她和你在一起呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She didn't come back? - I thought she was with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.98,1:02:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分开了，我们最好去找找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got separated. We better go look for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.61,1:02:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带小队继续前进，我们三点整在护盾发生器旁边会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the squad ahead. We'll meet at the shield generator at 03:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.78,1:02:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，R2，我们需要你的扫描器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, R2. We'll need your scanners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.07,1:02:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，卢克主人，我们知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Master Luke. We know what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.20,1:02:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还说这里很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you said it was pretty here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.10,1:03:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再碰我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.83,1:03:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.96,1:03:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我是困在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like I'm stuck here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.64,1:03:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕的是，我都不知道这是哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trouble is, I don't know where here is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.97,1:03:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你可以帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.18,1:03:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，坐这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.94,1:03:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证我决不伤害你，快过来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise I won't hurt you. Now come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.73,1:03:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，想吃点什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You want something to eat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.99,1:04:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.38,1:04:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.32,1:04:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看，只是顶头盔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. It's a hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.82,1:04:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会弄伤你的，来看看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna hurt you. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.66,1:04:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个小家伙神经真过敏啊，是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a jittery little thing, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.17,1:04:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.33,1:05:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.75,1:05:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.38,1:05:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去拿你的车，把她带回基地 - 遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get your ride. Take her back to base. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.98,1:05:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么…？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.20,1:06:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，我们离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.79,1:06:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你，让你待在指挥船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to remain on the command ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.38,1:06:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小队反抗军穿过了护盾，在恩多着陆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A small rebel force has penetrated the shield and landed on Endor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.72,1:06:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.97,1:07:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子和他们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son is with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.85,1:07:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你肯定吗？ - 我已经感觉到他了，我的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sure? - I have felt him, my master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.94,1:07:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪，我还没有感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange that I have not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.03,1:07:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对此事的感觉清楚无误吗，维德勋爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder if your feelings on this matter are clear, Lord Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.37,1:07:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很清楚，我的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are clear, my master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.25,1:07:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就要去那颗守护卫星等他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you must go to the sanctuary moon and wait for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.63,1:07:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会来找我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will come to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.88,1:07:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我已经预见到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have foreseen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.34,1:07:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对你的同情心会让他万劫不复\N{\fnArial\fs30}His compassion for you will be his undoing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.51,1:07:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会找到你，然后你要带他来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will come to you, and then you will bring him before me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.23,1:07:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谨遵圣意\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.33,1:08:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Luke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.46,1:08:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边还有两台毁掉的飞车\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's two more wrecked speeders back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.34,1:08:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我还找到了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I found this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.76,1:08:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕R2的传感器找不到任何莉娅公主的踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid that R2's sensors can find no trace of Princess Leia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.56,1:08:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望她一切平安\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope she's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.15,1:08:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事，楚伊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, Chewie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.95,1:08:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事，楚伊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, Chewie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.42,1:08:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂，不过是只死兽而已，有什么好看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it. It's just a dead animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.63,1:08:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊，等下，别碰！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, wait! Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.06,1:09:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.31,1:09:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的真棒，楚伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, Chewie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.27,1:09:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,太漂亮了，你总是用胃来思考的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Always thinking with your stomach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.48,1:09:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别抱怨了，我们还是来想想怎么出去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy. Let's just figure a way to get out of this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.78,1:09:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉，你能够碰到我的光剑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han, can you reach my lightsabre?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.61,1:09:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.12,1:09:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，我不知道这是不是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, I'm not sure that's such a good idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.79,1:09:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这么高掉下去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a very long drop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.71,1:10:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，别用那玩意指着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Point that thing someplace else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.18,1:10:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.43,1:10:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉，别这样，没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han, don't. It'll be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.15,1:10:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊，把你的弩给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, give them your crossbow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.69,1:10:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.57,1:10:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my goodness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.19,1:11:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂得他们在说什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand anything they're saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.24,1:11:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，是的，卢克主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, Master Luke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.78,1:11:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道我可是通晓超过六百万种…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that I am fluent in over six million forms-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.70,1:11:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他们说什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you telling them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.54,1:11:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我说的是“你好”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hello, " I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.75,1:11:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我也可能搞错了… 他们用的是一种很原始的语言…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could be mistaken… they're using a very primitive dialect…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.92,1:11:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我相信他们认为我是什么神\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I do believe they think I am some sort of god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.76,1:11:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你干嘛不对他们显示点神力，让我们离开这里呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you use your divine influence and get us out of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.39,1:11:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，索罗将军，但是这样做是不合适的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg your pardon, General Solo, but that just wouldn't be proper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.27,1:11:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,合适？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.77,1:11:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的程序不允许我假装成神祉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's against my programming to impersonate a deity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.52,1:11:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么，你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, you-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.99,1:11:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的错，请原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.20,1:12:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的老朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an old friend of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.32,1:12:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.88,1:12:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对此感觉很不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a really bad feeling about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.36,1:13:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.07,1:13:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说真让我尴尬，索罗将军…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm rather embarrassed, General Solo…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.53,1:13:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是看起来你好像是为我举办宴会的主菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it appears you are to be the main course at a banquet in my honour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.55,1:13:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Royal Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.05,1:13:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.89,1:13:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO，告诉他们必须要释放他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}3PO, tell them they must be set free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.92,1:14:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知怎么我感觉这好像没起什么作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow I got the feeling that didn't help us very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.21,1:14:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO，告诉他们如果他们不按你说的做…\N{\fnArial\fs30}3PO, tell them if they don't do as you wish…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.26,1:14:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会非常生气，并且会使用你的神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll become angry and use your magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.34,1:14:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，卢克主人，什么神力？我根本就不会什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Master Luke, what magic? I couldn't possibly…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.84,1:14:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么对他们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.32,1:14:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到没，卢克主人？他们不相信我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Master Luke? They didn't believe me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.53,1:14:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就如同我说的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just as I said they wouldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.24,1:14:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.17,1:14:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.47,1:14:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我下来，救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put me down! Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.30,1:14:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁放我下来啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.97,1:14:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.43,1:15:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克主人！R2，快救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Luke! R2, quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.88,1:15:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank goodness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.61,1:15:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你，3PO\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, 3PO.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.53,1:15:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来不知道我有这种能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never knew I had it in me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.08,1:16:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,…塔图因…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Tatooine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.96,1:16:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉娅公主… R2\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess Leia… R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.54,1:16:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,…达斯·维德！\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Darth Vader!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.13,1:16:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,…死星\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Death Star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.89,1:16:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,…绝地武士… 欧比·旺·科努比\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Jedi… Obi-Wan Kenobi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.73,1:16:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦，R2，我马上就要说到这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, R2, I was just coming to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.07,1:16:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克主人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Luke…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.74,1:16:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…千年鹰号…云雾城\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Millennium Falcon… Cloud City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.04,1:16:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,…维德！\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Vader!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.17,1:16:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉·索罗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han Solo…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.59,1:16:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,…碳化\N{\fnArial\fs30}…carbon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.63,1:16:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,…沙列克\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Sarlacc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.53,1:17:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？ - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.13,1:17:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了，我们现在是部落的一份子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonderful. We are now a part of the tribe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.22,1:17:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就等着这一天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just what I always wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.90,1:17:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮点忙也比不帮忙好啊，楚伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Short help's better than no help at all, Chewie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.83,1:18:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,侦察兵们会告诉我们通向护盾发生器最快的路在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scouts will show us the quickest way to the shield generator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.16,1:18:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了，有多远？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. How far is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.25,1:18:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.08,1:18:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了，我们还需要些补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need some fresh supplies too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.34,1:18:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有，最好能把我们的武器要回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try and get our weapons back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.76,1:18:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，我们时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up. I haven't got all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.47,1:18:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke, what's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.27,1:18:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉娅，你记得你的母亲吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leia, do you remember your mother-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.85,1:18:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真正的母亲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}your real mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.02,1:18:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,只记得一点了，我很小的时候她就去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little bit. She died when I was very young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.65,1:18:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.69,1:18:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一点印象了，还有感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just images really. Feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.41,1:18:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.70,1:18:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她…非常美\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was… very beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.87,1:18:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,很善良…但是也很忧伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind… but sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.67,1:18:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛问我这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you asking me this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.59,1:18:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点都不记得我母亲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no memory of my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.09,1:18:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没有见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never knew her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.89,1:18:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，告诉我，什么让你这么忧心忡忡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke, tell me. What's troubling you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.98,1:19:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,维德在这里，就是现在，就在这颗卫星上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vader is here. Now. On this moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.40,1:19:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.23,1:19:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到他的存在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt his presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.20,1:19:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来找我了，如果我离他足够近他就能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's come for me. He can feel when I'm near.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.57,1:19:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我为什么必须离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.58,1:19:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我待在这里，我就会危害到整组人的安全，也会影响任务的完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I stay, I'm endangering the group and our mission here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.08,1:19:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我必须要面对他 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to face him. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.05,1:19:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.97,1:19:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父亲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.81,1:19:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他的事，你可能听起来很难接受，但是你必须要接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more. It won't be easy for you to hear it, but you must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.94,1:19:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我回不来的话，你就是同盟军的唯一希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't make it back, you're the only hope for the Alliance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.90,1:19:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.52,1:19:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法理解你的能力，永远无法理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a power I don't understand and could never have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.15,1:19:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了，莉娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong, Leia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.28,1:19:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也有同样的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have that power too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.24,1:20:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,等时间到了，你会和我一样学会使用这种力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}In time, you'll learn to use it as I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.21,1:20:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,“原力”在我的家族中都很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Force is strong in my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.00,1:20:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲拥有它\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father has it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.34,1:20:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拥有它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.34,1:20:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.97,1:20:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的姐妹也拥有它\N{\fnArial\fs30}my sister has it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.65,1:20:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，就是你，莉娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. It's you, Leia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.03,1:20:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.49,1:20:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道怎么回事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.83,1:20:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直能体会到这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.54,1:20:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就知道为什么我必须要面对他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you know why I have to face him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.63,1:20:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，跑吧，跑远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke, run away. Far away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.17,1:20:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他能感觉到你的存在，就离开这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he can feel your presence, then leave this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.63,1:20:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我多希望我能和你一起去啊 - 不，你不能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wish I could go with you. - No, you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.01,1:20:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直都很坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've always been strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.27,1:21:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是为什么你必须要面对他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why must you confront him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.69,1:21:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他的心中还有善良，我可以感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because there is good in him. I've felt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.52,1:21:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会把我转变到皇帝那边去.\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't turn me over to the emperor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.65,1:21:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,相反的，我可以拯救他，把他转变到正义的这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can save him. I can turn him back to the good side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.20,1:21:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须要试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.51,1:21:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，你们在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.22,1:21:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么，我只是想单独待一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. I just wanna be alone for a little while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.89,1:21:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.31,1:21:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我，怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me. What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.40,1:21:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.20,1:21:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你能对卢克说？你只能对他说吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you tell Luke? Is that who you could tell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.68,1:22:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.02,1:22:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.03,1:23:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是投降的反叛军\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the rebel that surrendered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.04,1:23:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管他否认，我还是相信还有更多他们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although he denies it, I believe there may be more of them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.08,1:23:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请求批准对这一地区作进一步搜索\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I request permission to conduct a further search of the area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.88,1:23:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他身上的武器只有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was armed only with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.59,1:23:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的很好，指挥官阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work, Commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.42,1:23:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.47,1:23:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行搜索，把他的同伴抓来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conduct your search and bring his companions to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.60,1:23:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命，大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.19,1:23:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇帝陛下一直在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor has been expecting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.69,1:23:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.61,1:23:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说，你已经接受了事实了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you have accepted the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.11,1:23:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接受的事实是你曾经是天行者安纳金，父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've accepted the truth that you were once Anakin Skywalker, my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.74,1:23:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个名字对我已经没有任何意义了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That name no longer has any meaning for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.75,1:24:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那名字代表的才是真正的你，你只是忘了而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the name of your true self. You've only forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.29,1:24:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你心中还有善意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know there is good in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.04,1:24:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇帝没有从你心中全部夺走它\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor hasn't driven it from you fully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.63,1:24:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么你以前没有杀害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was why you couldn't destroy me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.89,1:24:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么你现在不会带我去见你的皇帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you won't bring me to your emperor now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.69,1:24:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你又制造了一柄新的光剑啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you have constructed a new lightsabre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.36,1:24:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的技巧已经尽善尽美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your skills are complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.54,1:24:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确实很强大，如同皇帝预见的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed you are powerful, as the emperor has foreseen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.09,1:24:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.93,1:24:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比·旺以前也这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obi-Wan once thought as you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.10,1:25:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你不知道黑暗的力量有多强\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know the power of the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.02,1:25:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须服从我的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must obey my master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.86,1:25:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会投入你的一方的，你只能被迫杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not turn, and you'll be forced to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.65,1:25:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是你的命运的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that is your destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.36,1:25:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细感觉一下，父亲，你怎么能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search your feelings, Father. You can't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.28,1:25:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到你心中的矛盾，放开你心中的仇恨吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel the conflict within you. Let go of your hate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.16,1:25:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了，儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is too late for me, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.80,1:25:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇帝陛下会向你展示“原力”的真实本质\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor will show you the true nature of the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.26,1:25:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在是你的主人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is your master now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.93,1:25:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我父亲就真的是死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then my father is truly dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.36,1:26:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制堡的主入口…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The main entrance to the control bunker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.40,1:26:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那着陆平台的另一端\N{\fnArial\fs30}is on the far side of that landing platform.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.28,1:26:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这任务不容易 - 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This isn't gonna be easy. - Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.03,1:26:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊和我去过很多比这更防卫森严的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie and me got into a lot of places more heavily guarded than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.50,1:26:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.25,1:26:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说有一条秘密通道通向山脊的另一侧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says there's a secret entrance on the other side of the ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.82,1:27:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,司令官，我们已经就位了，所有战机都准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral, we're in position. All fighters accounted for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.07,1:27:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备倒数计时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed with the countdown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.24,1:27:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有部队准备进入攻击坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}All groups assume attack coordinates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.08,1:27:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，我的朋友在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. My friend's down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.17,1:27:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会按时解除护盾的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll have that shield down on time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.67,1:27:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不然这就是历时最短的攻击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or this'll be the shortest offensive of all time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.14,1:27:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有飞船，按我命令，准备进行超空间跳跃\N{\fnArial\fs30}All craft, prepare to jump into hyperspace on my mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.97,1:27:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.54,1:28:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,后门，是吧？这主意不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back door, huh? Good idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.05,1:28:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有几个警卫，应该不怎么困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only a few guards. This shouldn't be too much trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.18,1:28:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要一个人发现就足以拉响警报了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It only takes one to sound the alarm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.14,1:28:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就无声无息的把他们干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll do it real quiet-like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.77,1:28:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦，天啊，莉娅公主 - 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my. Princess Leia. - Quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.61,1:28:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕我们的毛绒同伴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid our furry companion…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.53,1:28:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经跑过去做什么冒失的举动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}has gone and done something rather rash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.16,1:28:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然袭击没戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There goes our surprise attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.42,1:28:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看，那里！抓住他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, over there! Stop him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.56,1:29:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小毛球干的还真不错，就剩一个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad for a little furball. There's only one left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.73,1:29:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你待在这里，我们会解决掉他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here. We'll take care of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.32,1:29:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定我们应该待在此处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have decided that we shall stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.39,1:29:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.54,1:30:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎啊，年轻的天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, young Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.46,1:30:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等你多时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been expecting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.84,1:30:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再也不需要那些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll no longer need those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.27,1:31:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,警卫，你可以退下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards, leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.57,1:31:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正期待着完成你的训练呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking forward to completing your training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.16,1:31:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时，你就会承认我是你的主人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In time, you will call me master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.37,1:31:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就大错特错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gravely mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.96,1:31:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法像对我父亲一样转变我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't convert me as you did my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.96,1:31:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不，年轻的绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, my young Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.84,1:31:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会发现错的是你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will find that it is you who are mistaken…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.35,1:31:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你对于很多事情理解都是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}about a great many things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.18,1:31:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他的光剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}His lightsabre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.94,1:31:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，没错，绝地武士的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes. AJedi's weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.40,1:31:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你父亲的差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much like your father's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.94,1:31:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你要知道你父亲再也无法脱离黑暗一方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By now you must know your father can never be turned from the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.87,1:31:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你也将如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}So will it be with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.83,1:32:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.00,1:32:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快我就会死去…而你会和我一起死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon I'll be dead- and you with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.54,1:32:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你说的是你们反叛舰队马上要进行的攻击吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you refer to the imminent attack of your rebel fleet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.67,1:32:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.22,1:32:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证我们待在这里是非常安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assure you we are quite safe from your friends here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.52,1:32:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的过于自信正是你的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your overconfidence is your weakness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.52,1:32:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对于你朋友的迷信则是你的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your faith in your friends is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.19,1:32:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,反抗是无意义的，儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is pointless to resist, my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.83,1:32:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经发生的一切都是按我的剧本在进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything that has transpired has done so according to my design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.41,1:32:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在守护卫星上的那群朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends up there on the sanctuary moon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.75,1:32:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在迈进一个陷阱，你们的反抗舰队也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}are walking into a trap, as is your rebel fleet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.01,1:32:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我允许同盟军…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was I who allowed the Alliance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.64,1:32:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道护盾发生器的地点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to know the location of the shield generator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.18,1:33:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们那一小群可怜的家伙对它是无法撼动分毫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is quite safe from your pitiful little band.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.35,1:33:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群我最好的部队正在等待着他们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}An entire legion of my best troops awaits them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.11,1:33:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕偏导护盾…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid the deflector shield…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.99,1:33:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,到你朋友来的时候还会工作的很正常呢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be quite operational when your friends arrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.75,1:33:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.21,1:33:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来！走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.83,1:33:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly. Quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.80,1:33:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉，快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han, hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.55,1:33:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰队马上就要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fleet will be here any moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.14,1:33:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊，上啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charges. Come on. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.52,1:33:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天啊，他们会被抓的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my. They'll be captured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.23,1:33:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！回来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.44,1:33:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，和我待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, stay with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.28,1:33:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.28,1:33:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群反叛的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rebel scum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.93,1:34:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有部门向我报告 - 红色长机待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All wings report in. - Red Leader standing by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.44,1:34:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 灰色长机待命 - 绿色长机待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grey Leader standing by. - Green Leader standing by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.48,1:34:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,将S型叶片锁定在攻击位置上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock S-foils in attack positions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.28,1:34:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿“原力”与我们同在！\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the Force be with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.99,1:34:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上就能知道这个护盾究竟是不是解除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've gotta be able to get a reading on that shield- up or down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.66,1:34:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们不知道我们会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could they be jamming us if they don't know-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.38,1:34:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么会干扰我们的通信\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we're coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.09,1:34:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃进攻，护盾仍然在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break off the attack. The shield is still up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.72,1:34:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有收到任何探测数据，你肯定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get no reading. You sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.93,1:34:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉起！所有飞船拉起！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up! All craft pull up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.60,1:35:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行规避动作，绿色编队，紧密控制MV-7地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take evasive action. Green Group, stick close to Holding Sector MV-7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.40,1:35:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,司令官，47区发现敌舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral, we have enemy ships in Sector 47.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.28,1:35:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.36,1:35:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,战机逼近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighters coming in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.79,1:35:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们数量太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's too many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.46,1:35:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,加速至战斗速度，吸引他们的火力，不要让他们射击巡洋舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accelerate to attack speed. Draw their fire away from the cruisers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.96,1:35:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,金色长机，遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy, Gold Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.42,1:35:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.80,1:35:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}See for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.43,1:35:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这里，你将见证到同盟军的最后毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}From here, you will witness the final destruction of the Alliance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.77,1:35:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你们那无关痛痒的反叛的最后终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the end of your insignificant rebellion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.86,1:35:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.99,1:35:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.99,1:36:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你胸中的仇恨正越来越强\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hate is swelling in you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.29,1:36:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿起你的绝地武器吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your Jedi weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.59,1:36:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,用他来杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.46,1:36:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在手无存铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am unarmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.55,1:36:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,用他把我击倒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike me down with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.55,1:36:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,屈服于你的愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give in to your anger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.14,1:36:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一刻，你都将逐渐变成我的仆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}With each passing moment you make yourself more my servant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.86,1:36:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是无可避免的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is unavoidable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.99,1:36:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你命中注定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is your destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.16,1:36:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你，和你父亲一样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, like your father…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.41,1:36:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}are now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.95,1:36:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.72,1:37:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦，快走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, move it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.07,1:37:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂，我说，那边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. I say, over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.65,1:37:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在找我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you looking for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.16,1:37:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那两个家伙抓过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring those two down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.83,1:37:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们过来了，R2，你肯定这是个好主意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're on their way. R2, are you sure this was a good idea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.26,1:37:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.72,1:37:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.97,1:37:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}We surrender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.56,1:39:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码已经变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The code's changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.56,1:39:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们需要R2 - 终端在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need R2. - Here's the terminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.06,1:39:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.19,1:39:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,到地堡这里来，我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you at the bunker right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.24,1:39:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,走？你什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going? What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.45,1:39:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪里啊，R2？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going where, R2?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.20,1:40:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，R2，这可不是逞英雄的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. R2, this is no time for heroics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.54,1:40:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.44,1:40:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心，威治，有三架从你头顶方向来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch yourself, Wedge. Three from above.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.36,1:40:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 红色三号，红色二号，靠近我 - 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Red Three, Red Two, pull in. - Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.53,1:40:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,三架敌机逼近，角度20度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three of them coming in, 20 degrees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.41,1:40:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,向左急转，我对付长机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut left. I'll take the leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.46,1:40:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正飞向医疗舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're heading for the medical frigate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.22,1:40:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,气压稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pressure's steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.61,1:41:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有战斗机在攻击，灭星者在等什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the fighters are attacking. What are the Stardestroyers waiting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.53,1:41:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官！我们已经就位，准备攻击！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in attack position, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.37,1:41:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就地等待 - 我们不进攻吗，长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold here. - We're not going to attack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.66,1:41:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的命令是陛下亲自下的，他有特殊计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}My orders are from the emperor himself. He has something special planned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.08,1:41:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要防止他们逃跑即可\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only need to keep them from escaping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.71,1:41:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如你所见，年轻的学徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, my young apprentice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.92,1:41:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友们已经失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your friends have failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.97,1:41:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在看看这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now witness the firepower…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.47,1:41:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,全副武装的战斗基地的威力吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}of this fully armed and operational battle station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.98,1:41:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官，自由射击！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire at will, Commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.53,1:41:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.87,1:42:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是从死星射出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That blast came from the Death Star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.37,1:42:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙可以工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing's operational.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.84,1:42:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,大本营一号，这是金色长机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home 1, this is Gold Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.80,1:42:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也见到了，所有部队准备撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saw it. All craft prepare to retreat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.01,1:42:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你再不会得到这么好的机会了，司令官\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't get another chance at this, Admiral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.34,1:42:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别无选择，卡尔瑞辛将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no choice, General Calrissian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.22,1:42:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的巡洋舰顶不住那个级别的攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our cruisers can't repel firepower of that magnitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.64,1:42:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉会解除那个护盾的，我们要给他更多的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han will have that shield down. We've gotta give him more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.16,1:42:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.46,1:42:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.59,1:42:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.02,1:43:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My goodness!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.07,1:43:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛要这么英勇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you have to be so brave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.24,1:43:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我猜我能找到开门的线路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I suppose I could hot-wire this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.91,1:43:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我掩护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll cover you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.95,1:44:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，靠近，能有多近就有多近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I said closer. Move as close as you can…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.54,1:44:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在极近距离对灭星者进行攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}and engage those Stardestroyers at point-blank range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.38,1:44:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在那种距离我们顶不住灭星者多久的攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}At that close range, we won't last long against those Stardestroyers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.92,1:44:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码比死星的攻击顶的要久\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll last longer than we will against that Death Star…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.67,1:44:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说不定还能干掉一两艘\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we might take a few of them with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.85,1:44:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要爆炸啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna blow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.27,1:44:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被击中了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.03,1:44:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的舰队已经失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your fleet is lost…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.32,1:44:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你在恩多卫星上的朋友们也不可能存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your friends on the Endor moon will not survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.66,1:44:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,无路可逃啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no escape…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.20,1:44:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻的学徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}my young apprentice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.04,1:44:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,同盟即将毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Alliance will die…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.38,1:44:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友也将死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}as will your friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.84,1:44:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.14,1:45:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到你的愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel your anger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.14,1:45:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在没有防护，拿起你的武器吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am defenceless. Take your weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.77,1:45:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的仇恨将我击倒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike me down with all of your hatred…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.03,1:45:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就将彻底进入黑暗一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your journey towards the dark side will be complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.82,1:45:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看！ - 把他从那弄走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look! - Get him off of there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.03,1:47:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我找到方法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.15,1:47:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.70,1:48:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.12,1:48:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我看看 - 还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's see. - It's not bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.12,1:48:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 站住！ - 哦，亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Freeze! - Oh, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.54,1:48:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.51,1:48:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.34,1:48:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.80,1:48:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.86,1:48:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.24,1:48:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来，她受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down here. She's wounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.08,1:48:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.04,1:48:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有法子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got an idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.93,1:48:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.55,1:48:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉你好战的心吧，孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use your aggressive feelings, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.47,1:49:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让仇恨充满你的全身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the hate flow through you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.86,1:49:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比·旺把你教的不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obi-Wan has taught you well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.91,1:49:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会和你作战了，父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not fight you, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.38,1:49:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下你的武器是很不明智的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are unwise to lower your defences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.12,1:50:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的思想背叛了你，父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your thoughts betray you, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.66,1:50:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到你内心的善良，矛盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel the good in you, the conflict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.92,1:50:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么矛盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no conflict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.76,1:50:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前没办法让自己杀掉我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't bring yourself to kill me before…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.84,1:50:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信现在你就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't believe you'll destroy me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.93,1:50:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太低估黑暗的力量了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You underestimate the power of the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.60,1:50:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you will not fight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.56,1:50:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会落入你注定的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you will meet your destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.61,1:50:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.95,1:50:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.04,1:50:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 注意，6点方向有敌机 - 金色长机，我来对付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch out. Squad at.06. - I'm on it, Gold Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.59,1:50:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,打的漂亮，红色二号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good shot, Red Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.64,1:50:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在肯定已经在其中了，汉，快点啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're sure in the middle of it now. Come on, Han, old buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.85,1:51:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我们失望啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let me down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.06,1:51:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了，指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over, Commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.65,1:51:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,反叛军已经被击溃，他们正在四散奔逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rebels have been routed. They're fleeing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.11,1:51:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要增援以便继续追击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need reinforcements to continue the pursuit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.74,1:51:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,派三个班过去帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send three squads to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.82,1:51:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打开后门 - 遵命，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Open the back door. - Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.97,1:51:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,再扔给我一颗炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw me another charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.94,1:51:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能永远躲避，卢克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot hide forever, Luke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.99,1:51:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会和你作战的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not fight you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.41,1:52:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,来黑暗这方吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give yourself to the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.04,1:52:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这样才能救你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the only way you can save your friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.13,1:52:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.97,1:52:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的思想背叛了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your thoughts betray you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.05,1:52:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他们的感情是如此之深…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your feelings for them are strong…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.72,1:52:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是对\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially for…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.77,1:52:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.69,1:52:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一个孪生姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you have a twin sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.15,1:52:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的感觉也正在背叛她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your feelings have now betrayed her too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.99,1:52:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比·旺很聪明，把她偷偷藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obi-Wan was wise to hide her from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.20,1:52:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过现在他是彻底失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now his failure is complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.08,1:52:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不愿意投入黑暗一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you will not turn to the dark side…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.00,1:52:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也许她会\N{\fnArial\fs30}then perhaps she will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.92,1:52:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.47,1:53:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.52,1:53:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的恨意让你强大！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hate has made you powerful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.52,1:53:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，走完你注定要走的路…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, fulfil your destiny…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.53,1:53:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,取代你父亲的位置，在我身边为我服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take your father's place at my side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.67,1:54:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,决不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.05,1:54:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决不会投入黑暗一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never turn to the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.18,1:54:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你失败了，皇帝陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've failed, Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.14,1:54:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一个绝地武士…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a Jedi…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.23,1:54:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如同我面前的父亲一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like my father before me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.86,1:54:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}So be it, Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.53,1:54:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.05,1:54:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,护盾已经解除了，对死星主反应堆发动攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shield is down. Commence attack on the Death Star's main reactor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.05,1:54:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上就去，红色编队，金色编队，所有战机跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on our way. Red Group, Gold Group, all fighters follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.93,1:55:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你他们一定能办到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you they'd do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.98,1:55:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不愿投入我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you will not be turned…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.74,1:55:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会被消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will be destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.25,1:55:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻的傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.92,1:55:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，到了这最后时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only now, at the end…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.75,1:55:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.85,1:55:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那点微末功夫根本无法和黑暗的力量相提并论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your feeble skills are no match for the power of the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.45,1:55:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太没眼光了，你会为此付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have paid the price for your lack of vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.87,1:56:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲，救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.01,1:56:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，年轻的天行者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, young Skywalker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.31,1:56:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.90,1:57:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.53,1:57:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here goes nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.83,1:58:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,去最强的火力区，能源发生器一定在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock onto the strongest power source. It should be the power generator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.92,1:58:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持编队，小心驾驶，我们可能很快就没有足够空间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Form up. Stay alert. We could run out of space real fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.06,1:58:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,分开，飞回到表面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Split up and head back to the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.19,1:58:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你能不能吸引一些敌机跟住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if you can get a few of those TIE fighters to follow you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.49,1:58:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命，金色长机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy, Gold Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.75,1:58:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,太近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was too close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.34,1:58:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得给那些战机更多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to give those fighters more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.63,1:58:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,击中火力射击超级灭星者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concentrate all fire on that Super Stardestroyer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.81,1:59:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，舰桥的偏导护盾已经失效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we've lost our bridge deflector shields.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.06,1:59:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,增加前方火力，我不希望任何东西穿过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intensify the forward batteries. I don't want anything to get through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.57,1:59:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,增加前方火力！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intensify forward firepower!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.15,1:59:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.45,2:00:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我把这个面具取下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me take this mask off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.45,2:00:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这样你会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'll die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.21,2:00:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没有什么能救我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing can stop that now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.80,2:00:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是起码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for once…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.38,2:00:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}let me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.13,2:00:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲眼看你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}look on you with my own eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.84,2:00:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，走吧，儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go, my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.93,2:01:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.43,2:01:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我要带你一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You're coming with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.02,2:01:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会留你在这里的，我要救活你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll not leave you here. I've got to save you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.23,2:01:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经救了我了，卢克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already have, Luke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.11,2:01:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.78,2:01:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我的看法是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.04,2:01:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你的姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell your sister…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.87,2:01:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.17,2:01:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.60,2:01:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会离开你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't leave you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.37,2:02:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.34,2:02:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,威治，去干掉北塔上的能源稳定器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wedge, go for the power regulator on the north tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:09.84,2:02:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命，金色长机，我马上就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy, Gold Leader. I'm already on my way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.36,2:02:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,让舰队远离死星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move the fleet away from the Death Star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.71,2:03:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.84,2:03:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定那东西爆炸的时候卢克不在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure Luke wasn't on that thing when it blew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.01,2:03:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.97,2:03:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.31,2:03:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You love him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.32,2:03:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.86,2:03:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.45,2:03:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.28,2:03:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.70,2:04:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他回来以后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he comes back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:01.58,2:04:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会挡你们的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't get in the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:06.04,2:04:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你想的那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like that at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.72,2:04:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.66,2:05:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,威萨自由了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wesa free!{\r}
